From e38ae5c5d1eaeede188de97d02d25ab9f354fd82 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: blazerpaul15 <blazerpaul15@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 16:50:45 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] base: Add bypass charging support
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- GameSpaceService now publishes the game_space binder with
  IGameSpaceService (setBypassCharge, isBypassChargeActive,
  getBypassChargePowerMicrowatts), guarded by WRITE_SECURE_SETTINGS.
- GameStateDispatcher tracks manual and game bypass requests
  separately. While power is connected it saves the Lineage Health
  charging control state, holds charge at the current level with
  MODE_LIMIT, publishes Settings.Global bypass_charge_active and
  restores the saved state afterwards. A stale bypass state is restored
  and the power receiver registered once GameSpace starts. EvoX's
  GameSpace session handling is unchanged.
- SystemUI: Bypass charging QS tile, Ax platform feature, bypass battery
  glyph, and a lock screen "Bypass charging • X.X W" indication.

Gated by persist.sys.battery_bypass_supported.

Assisted-by: LLM

